          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of your Shooting phase, select one enemy unit that is visible to this model. Until the end of the phase, each time a friendly **^^Adeptus Astartes**^^ model makes an attack with a **[BLAST]** weapon that targets that enemy unit, add 1 to the Hit roll and that attack has the **[IGNORES COVER]** ability.</characteristic>
