        <profile name="Honour or Death" id="c13d-1672-b49b-371d" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While a friendly unit is affected by a Battlefield Command Stratagem used by this model, add 1 to Advance and Charge rolls made for that unit and you can target that unit with the Heroic Intervention  stratagem for 0CP, even if you have already used that Stratagem on a different unit this phase.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Martial Superiority" id="6e30-67a0-e97d-3512" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time this model makes a melee attack that targets a **^^Character^^** unit, you can re-roll the Hit roll and you can re-roll the Wound roll</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Leader" id="f866-2e66-d276-7cc0" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">This model can use the Battlefield Command Stratagem on the following units:

■ **^^Assault Intercessor Squad^^**
■ **^^Bladeguard Veteran Squad^^**
■ **^^Infernus Squad^^**
■ **^^Intercessor Squad^^**
■ **^^Sternguard Veteran Squad^^**</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
