            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While a friendly **^^Adeptus Astartes^^** unit is within 6&quot; of the bearer, each time you target that unit with a Stratagem, roll one D6: on a 5+, you gain 1CP.</characteristic>
