                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of the first battle round, the bearer’s unit and up to one other friendly unit within the same Entry Zone can each make a Normal move of up to 6&quot;.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
